# Earth Lens — production environment
#
# This app requires NO production environment variables to build, run, or deploy.
#   - Landsat imagery comes from the Microsoft Planetary Computer STAC API,
#     which is keyless (no token / API key needed).
#   - The scene inventory is committed to the repo (data/scene-inventory.json)
#     and bundled at build time, so nothing is fetched from a secret-gated source.
#
# Therefore this file intentionally contains NO key=value pairs.
# Do NOT put secrets here — anything committed here is public in the repo.
#
# NOTE: Deploy credentials (VERCEL_TOKEN / VERCEL_ORG_ID / VERCEL_PROJECT_ID)
# are CI secrets used by .github/workflows/deploy.yml — they are configured as
# GitHub repository secrets, NOT in this file.
#
# If a public, client-exposed value is ever needed, add it as NEXT_PUBLIC_*, e.g.:
#   NEXT_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=https://your-deployment.example.com
